  CurrentGameplayState: 1
  _tutorialSprite: {fileID: -6248741079362886434, guid: fb730fb58019a604f8e2223953a42332, type: 3}
  _tutorialDialogue:
  - Ah boy, I heard from your father that you were looking for a job, and that maybe
    I could hire you to work here temporarily.
  - Good lah. Time for you to experience the real world before you get too sheltered.
  - "Now you may be my nephew, but don\u2019t go thinking that I will go soft on
    you, I treat my employees all the same."
  - 'The only exception is your aunt, heh. '
  - Let's get started. You'll make two drinks for me.
  - 'First, let''s make Kopi. Kopi is made with coffee, sugar, condensed milk and
    water. '
  - Not bad, let's try another drink called Kopi O.
  - Kopi O is just Kopi but the 'O' means no condensed milk. Just put coffee and
    sugar with water.
  - "Alright, I\u2019ll let you serve 3 customers for today, don\u2019t mess this
    up ah!"
  skip: 0
